factorium-pointer-registry-delta-v0
extends proof-set-pointer-registry-v5.factorium
pointer baseline | Baseline | a structural label for the declared starting state, comparator, or reference condition
pointer channel | Channel | a structural label for a route through which material, information, influence, or action passes
pointer compatibility | Compatibility | a structural label for whether subjects can coexist, interoperate, or satisfy a shared contract
pointer concurrency | Concurrency | a structural label for overlapping activity, access, or execution under coordination constraints
pointer feasibility | Feasibility | a structural label for whether a candidate can satisfy requirements under available conditions
pointer field | Field | a structural label for a spatially or structurally distributed value, influence, or record component
pointer frequency | Frequency | a structural label for occurrence count, cycles, or updates per a declared interval
pointer membership | Membership | a structural label for inclusion in a set, organization, class, or composition
pointer monitoring | Monitoring | a structural label for repeated observation of indicators, states, events, or thresholds
pointer obligation | Obligation | a structural label for required conduct or result under an authority and scope
pointer position | Position | a structural label for location, ordered placement, or organization-defined work slot
pointer response | Response | a structural label for a reaction, action, output, or disposition following a condition or signal
pointer selection | Selection | a structural label for choosing one or more candidates under criteria and authority
pointer service | Service | a structural label for provided behavior or capability under a boundary and commitment
pointer score | Score | a structural label for an assigned result on a declared scale, rule, and evidence basis
pointer transition | Transition | a structural label for movement between states, phases, versions, or lifecycle stages
pointer trigger | Trigger | a structural label for a condition or event that initiates an action, transition, or review
pointer validation | Validation | a structural label for evidence that a subject is suitable for an intended use
pointer verification | Verification | a structural label for evidence that a subject satisfies specified requirements
pointer intervention | Intervention | a structural label for an intentional action intended to alter a state, process, or outcome
end-factorium-pointer-registry
